<section class="panel" aria-label="Grade 3 Unit5 Lesson2 Name Parts as Fractions"><h2>Original warm-up: equal AREA, not necessarily matching shapes</h2><p>A shaded L-shaped irregular region is half the area of its rectangle; B has one equal third shaded; C has two UNEQUAL regions; D has one of two equal horizontal halves shaded. Source A–D image labels checked directly from 2021 original HTML and SVGs.</p><h2>Partition the Strips</h2><p>Start with SIX EQUAL WHOLE strips; keep one whole1, fold FIVE others into halves, thirds, fourths, sixths, eighths. Label every piece. Original strips must be kept for future lessons.</p><div><strong>1/2</strong><div role="img" aria-label="First party fraction strip: one of 2 equal parts shaded" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,110px);width:max-content;margin:7px 0"><span style="width:110px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:#b1dcea" aria-label="Equal part 1"></span><span style="width:110px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:white" aria-label="Equal part 2"></span></div></div><div><strong>1/3</strong><div role="img" aria-label="First party fraction strip: one of 3 equal parts shaded" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,73px);width:max-content;margin:7px 0"><span style="width:73px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:#b1dcea" aria-label="Equal part 1"></span><span style="width:73px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:white" aria-label="Equal part 2"></span><span style="width:73px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:white" aria-label="Equal part 3"></span></div></div><div><strong>1/4</strong><div role="img" aria-label="First party fraction strip: one of 4 equal parts shaded" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,55px);width:max-content;margin:7px 0"><span style="width:55px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:#b1dcea" aria-label="Equal part 1"></span><span style="width:55px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:white" aria-label="Equal part 2"></span><span style="width:55px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:white" aria-label="Equal part 3"></span><span style="width:55px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:white" aria-label="Equal part 4"></span></div></div><div><strong>1/6</strong><div role="img" aria-label="First party fraction strip: one of 6 equal parts shaded" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,36px);width:max-content;margin:7px 0"><span style="width:36px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:#b1dcea" aria-label="Equal part 1"></span><span style="width:36px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:white" aria-label="Equal part 2"></span><span style="width:36px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:white" aria-label="Equal part 3"></span><span style="width:36px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:white" aria-label="Equal part 4"></span><span style="width:36px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:white" aria-label="Equal part 5"></span><span style="width:36px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:white" aria-label="Equal part 6"></span></div></div><div><strong>1/8</strong><div role="img" aria-label="First party fraction strip: one of 8 equal parts shaded" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(8,27px);width:max-content;margin:7px 0"><span style="width:27px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:#b1dcea" aria-label="Equal part 1"></span><span style="width:27px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:white" aria-label="Equal part 2"></span><span style="width:27px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:white" aria-label="Equal part 3"></span><span style="width:27px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:white" aria-label="Equal part 4"></span><span style="width:27px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:white" aria-label="Equal part 5"></span><span style="width:27px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:white" aria-label="Equal part 6"></span><span style="width:27px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:white" aria-label="Equal part 7"></span><span style="width:27px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:white" aria-label="Equal part 8"></span></div></div><h2>Partition, Shade, Trade</h2><p>Draw equal regions and label each. Then make a SECRET equal partition and shade ONE part, WITHOUT writing the fraction; swap with a partner and ask them to identify1/n. No unique source-fixed n: teacher checks the visual and justification.</p><h2>Original synthesis: six equal pieces, only one sixth shaded</h2><div role="img" aria-label="First party fraction strip: one of 6 equal parts shaded" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,36px);width:max-content;margin:7px 0"><span style="width:36px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:#b1dcea" aria-label="Equal part 1"></span><span style="width:36px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:white" aria-label="Equal part 2"></span><span style="width:36px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:white" aria-label="Equal part 3"></span><span style="width:36px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:white" aria-label="Equal part 4"></span><span style="width:36px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:white" aria-label="Equal part 5"></span><span style="width:36px;height:46px;border:1px solid #547899;background:white" aria-label="Equal part 6"></span></div><p>Publisher original Fold Strip blackline and gated Label the Parts Cool-down not copied. <a href="https://im.kendallhunt.com/k5/teachers/grade-3/unit-5/lesson-2/lesson.html">2021 original teacher lesson</a></p></section>
